disp: NOT_AN_INDEPENDENT_CONSTRAINT
nature: IMPLEMENTATION_DETAIL (lexical approximation inside the in-root path helper)
appl: actor=hook helper repoRelative; action=treat a relative path beginning with '..' as outside the root; trigger=file path whose first in-root component starts with two dots; modality=NONE (implementation predicate); scope=file-change and manifest-change hooks; exceptions=none; timing=hook execution; enforcement=static code read, not executed; loading=hook code
