appl: actor=dependency-guard via manifestChanges; action=collect no candidates and run no check; trigger=baseline snapshot exists and git status fails; modality=NONE (absence of enforcement); scope=post-tool manifest checks; exceptions=none; timing=after a shell command; enforcement=static code read, not executed; loading=hook code
