nature: SELECTION GUIDANCE with an exclusion condition (keyed services)
appl: actor=agent using the dependency-injection knowledge skill; action=do not use keyed services when a single registration or a simple explicit factory is clearer; trigger=choosing a DI selection technique; modality=GUIDANCE (use ... not when ...); scope=dependency-injection knowledge skill; exceptions=keyed services fit when implementations are selected by a known key and alternatives are not clearer; timing=design; enforcement=none; loading=on-demand knowledge skill declared '(no policy)'
